 is  now changing we are able to influence  them  in a good way like open their minds and  sent them home with  some thoughts so that's kind of how i  see it as an opportunity  turning a last chance into a first step  in better understanding our changing  planet  for cbs morning's ben tracy iceland  the milking tourist joke was just a joke  because i could see people going ah okay  because he clearly loves his country  yeah really loves the country wants us  to come and see it and have a good time  when we're there doesn't make me want to  go yeah i'd love to go actually uh you  know you could also stay here at home  glacier national park uh in america also  receding glaciers but lance last chance  tourism melting glaciers it kind of  feels like you're visiting a relative  dying of old age  yeah because you're looking at something  that's disappearing right in front of  you it's somewhat sad i hope it's  something that's us that we need to do  more to say this 100 sad yeah

